<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86618" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προαπ-ελαύνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drive away before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς μελίττας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					15.5.5
				</span></i>
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προαπ-έρχομαι</span></b> , <i>go away
				before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὶν τὸν Βρασίδαν ἰδεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.125
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.323
			</span></i>: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴκαδε π. τοῦ χρόνου</span>
			<i>depart before</i> the time, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				943d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>die before,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Or.</u>
				55.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Him.
				<u>Or.</u>
				23.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἐπιδημίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eun.
					<u>VS</u>
					p.494
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>die for,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς πατρίδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Eth.</u>
					22.5
				</span></i>
			.</div>
